1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,992
It also depends on frequency.

2
00:00:01,992 --> 00:00:06,471
Your ear is most sensitive between about one and five kilohertz.

3
00:00:06,471 --> 00:00:13,489
So a deep hundred hertz hum and a three kilohertz whistle with the same intensity do not sound equally loud.

